      "title": "Add DECT NR+ MAC layer",
      "message": "Add DECT NR+ MAC layer\n\nDECT NR+ is specified in ETSI TS 103 636.\n\nA preference is available to configure the Physical Header Field\ntype (40 bits or 80 bits) if the trace does not follow the spec\ndefined for WTAP_ENCAP_DECT_NR.\n\nA preference is available to configure DLC PDU data type. The\ndefault Automatic configuration will use heuristics to detect IPv6.\n\nThe specification uses different field lengths based on the value\nof µ (subcarrier scaling factor). This is handled here by checking\nthe expected length for a message or IE.\n\nThe use of CVG Protocol Data Units is not implemented.\n",
      "author_name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
      "author_email": "stig@bjorlykke.org",
      "authored_date": "2025-08-26T12:25:00.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
      "committer_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
